cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fc-variant-atlas: aligned, sequence-validated engineered IgG Fc variants with measured structural context"
message: "If you use this software or its curated data, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Damko
    given-names: Ermelinda
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dataRichinsightPoor/fc-variant-atlas"
abstract: >-
  A curated, machine-readable atlas of engineered human IgG Fc variants
  (effector silencing, effector enhancement, half-life engineering,
  heterodimerization, hexamerization, conjugation, stabilization), aligned
  across IgG1 to IgG4 in EU numbering, with every substitution validated
  against the UniProt reference sequence and with interface contacts measured
  directly from deposited coordinates. Ships a browser viewer and generated
  PyMOL scripts so any variant can be inspected structurally without manual
  setup.
keywords:
  - antibody engineering
  - Fc silencing
  - EU numbering
  - FcgammaR
  - FcRn
  - structural bioinformatics
